s8-1-p5 = prose (cons "The original source language may have no syntax for cubical paths, dependent products, or proofs. An extended presentation can carry those constructions alongside the source syntax and erase them when projecting to the original language. Erasure is sound for annotations that do not change runtime meaning. A metaprogram that generates new declarations or changes behavior instead requires elaboration and a semantic preservation or refinement theorem. These are different situations; they must not be collapsed into a single “zero-runtime annotation” claim." nil)
